    <string name="cold_start_last_app_delay">Dambisa ukuvula kabusha uhlelo lokusebenza lokugcina ngemuva kokuqalisa kabusha</string>
    <string name="cold_start_last_app_delay_summary">Uma inketho engenhla icimile, uhlelo lokusebenza obelise phambili luvulwa futhi ngemuva kokuqalisa kabusha idivayisi, ngokushesha nje lapho isikrini sasekhaya sesilungile. Uma lokhu kuvuliwe, isiqalisi silinda imizuzwana engu-5 kuze kuqale amasevisi eyunithi eyinhloko, futhi uma uhlelo lokusebenza luvaleka ngaphakathi kwemizuzwana engu-2 ngemuva kokuvulwa, luvulwa kanye futhi. Izinhlelo zokusebenza zokuqala ze-SYU ne-FYT (com.syu.*, com.fyt.*) zilitholo njalo; le nketho iyengeza kuzo zonke ezinye izinhlelo zokusebenza. Ayisetshenziswa ngemuva kokuvuka ekulaleni.</string>
    <string name="baseline_profile_summary">Isifinyezo se-Baseline Profile</string>
    <string name="baseline_profile_reset">Setha kabusha i-Baseline Profile</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_title">Setha kabusha ukuvuselelwa kokusetshenziswa</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_message">Isiqalisi siyazihlanganisa kabusha ngemuva kwezinsuku ezingu-3, 14 no-30 zokusetshenziswa, ukuze izici osebenzisa ngempela ziqale ngokushesha. Ukuvuselelwa ngakunye kudinga futhi inani eliphansi lezikhathi (5, bese kuba ngu-10). Isikhathi siwukuqalisa kabusha idivayisi noma ukuvuka ekulaleni okungenani imizuzu engu-3 ngemuva kwesikhathi esedlule. Ukuvuselelwa okuqediwe: %1$d kwangu-%2$d.\n\n• Setha kabusha ishejuli – igcina ukwenziwa kahle okuqoqiwe kuze kube manje futhi iqala kabusha ishejuli yezinsuku ezingu-3/14/30.\n\n• Ukusetha kabusha ngokuphelele – isula idatha yokusetshenziswa eqoqiwe, ibuyele kuphrofayela ezenzakalelayo eza nohlelo lokusebenza futhi iqale kabusha ishejuli.</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_schedule_btn">Setha kabusha ishejuli</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_full_btn">Ukusetha kabusha ngokuphelele…</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_full_title">Setha kabusha ngokuphelele?</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_full_message">Yonke idatha yokusetshenziswa eqoqwe selokhu kufakwa izosulwa unomphela. Isiqalisi sibuyela ku-Baseline Profile ezenzakalelayo eza nohlelo lokusebenza futhi ishejuli yokuvuselelwa yezinsuku ezingu-3/14/30 iqala kabusha.\n\nIsiqalisi singaqalisa kabusha. Kuze kuhlanganiswe kabusha (cishe imizuzu emi-2), ukuqala kungase kuhambe kancane kancane.</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_full_confirm_btn">Sula futhi uqalise kabusha</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_schedule_done">Ishejuli yokuvuselelwa isethwe kabusha. Ukuvuselelwa okulandelayo kuzosebenza ngemuva kwezinsuku ezingu-3 zokusetshenziswa.</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_reapplied">Idatha eqoqiwe ayikwazi ukusulwa nge-Shizuku ngaphandle kwe-root ku-Android 13 noma yangaphambili. Iphrofayela ezenzakalelayo isetshenziswe futhi futhi iyahlanganiswa ngemuva; idatha eqoqiwe iyahlala.</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_full_started">Idatha eqoqiwe isusiwe. Kuyahlanganiswa kabusha kusuka kuphrofayela ezenzakalelayo ngemuva.</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_failed">Ukusetha kabusha kuhlulekile. Zama futhi kamuva.</string>
    <string name="baseline_reset_unavailable">Ayitholakali kule divayisi.</string>
    <string name="autostart_apps">Qala ekuqaleni</string>
    <string name="autostart_apps_summary">Izinhlelo zokusebenza ezethulwa isici sokuqalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo sesistimu zingase zehlise ukuqala kwesiqalisi. Inketho eyakhelwe-ngaphakathi yesiqalisi izethula kuphela ngemuva kokuba isiqalisi siqede ukuqala kwaso okubandayo. Uma usebenzisa lolu hlu, khumbula ukukhubaza lezi zinhlelo zokusebenza ezilungiselelweni ze-FYT; ngaphandle kwalokho zizethulwa kabili.</string>
    <string name="autostart_apps_by_boot_completed">Zama ukusebenzisa ukusakaza kwe-BOOT_COMPLETED uma uhlelo lokusebenza olukhethiwe seluyibhalisile</string>

