    <string name="codes_guide_detailed_reading_title">Umhloli wamakhodi – ukufunda ngemininingwane</string>
    <string name="codes_guide_detailed_reading">Le ngxenye iyenzelwe ukuhlola uhlanganiso oluthile lwe-cmdInt ne-cmdArr ukuze kudalulwe amakhodi aqukethwe. Njengoba kushiwo ngaphambili, i-cmdInt ne-cmdArr abalulekile kancane futhi uhlanganiso oluningi olungahleliwe kufanele lusebenze. Leli modyuli lidalwe ngaphambi kokuba ngikwazi lokho, kodwa lingaba usizo ezivivinyweni ezithile.</string>
    <string name="codes_guide_miscellaneous_title">Okuhlukahlukene</string>
    <string name="codes_guide_miscellaneous">Yeqa amakhodi – njengoba igama lisho, lesi sigaba sihlose ukungawunaki ukufundwa kwamakhodi anikeziwe. Sisebenza kokubili ku-\"Isilogi samakhodi\" nakuMhloli wamakhodi. Cishe asisheshisi inqubo, kodwa amalogi ngeke aqukathe imiphumela ongayinakile.</string>
