    <string name="tv_map_str">Siyakwamukela ku-FYT Launcher Mod!\nDala isakhiwo sakho ukuze ubonise iwindi le-navi.\n\nLesi siqalisi sikuvumela ukuthi ubonise izinhlelo zokusebenza kumodi ye-Picture-in-Picture ngezindlela ezimbili ezahlukene, kodwa amanye amayunithi angase angasekeli noma iyiphi. Lokhu kusho ukuthi ngeke ukwazi ukubonisa uhlelo lokusebenza le-navi esikrinini esiyinhloko, ngaphandle uma ufaka kudivayisi yakho i-ROM yangokwezifiso esekelayo (uma i-ROM enjalo ikhona eyunithi yakho eyinhloko).\nUngasasebenzisa isiqalisi, kodwa uzodinga ukucisha i-PiP ezilungiselelweni zesiqalisi (ngaphandle kwalokho i-Google Maps izovela njalo uma uzama ukuvula ikhasi lasekhaya – uma kwenzeka, sula idatha yesiqalisi noma usifake kabusha).</string>

